{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782086692457,"sessionID":"ses_1135b46adffe7APFrgclWh2WTn","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_52566f9e9bd04ff389851338","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-2vdvakbf/retort-a07630997387/README.md"},"output":"<path>/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-2vdvakbf/retort-a07630997387/README.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Brazilian Soccer MCP with spec and basic data sets\n2: \n3: ## Specification\n4: brazilian-soccer-mcp-guide.md\n5: \n6: ## Data Sources\n7: Kaggle data can't be downloaded without an account so these (freely available with attribution) data sets have been downloaded for use here:\n8: \n9: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ricardomattos05/jogos-do-campeonato-brasileiro\n10: - License: Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)\n11: - data/kaggle/Brasileirao_Matches.csv\n12: - data/kaggle/Brazilian_Cup_Matches.csv\n13: - data/kaggle/Libertadores_Matches.csv\n14: \n15: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/cuecacuela/brazilian-football-matches\n16: - License: CC0: Public Domain\n17: - data/kaggle/BR-Football-Dataset.csv\n18: \n19: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/macedojleo/campeonato-brasileiro-2003-a-2019\n20: - License: World Bank - Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)\n21: - data/kaggle/novo_campeonato_brasileiro.csv\n22: \n23: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/youssefelbadry10/fifa-players-data\n24: - License: Apache 2.0\n25: - data/kaggle/fifa_data.csv\n\n(End of file - total 25 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Brazilian Soccer MCP with spec and basic data sets\n\n## Specification\nbrazilian-soccer-mcp-guide.md\n\n## Data Sources\nKaggle data can't be downloaded without an account so these (freely available with attribution) data sets have been downloaded for use here:\n\nhttps://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ricardomattos05/jogos-do-campeonato-brasileiro\n- License: Attributi