{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1782086955864,"sessionID":"ses_1135b46adffe7APFrgclWh2WTn","part":{"id":"prt_eeca8f356001BPP7PTYYDWjP6A","messageID":"msg_eeca8ee9d00174pTtQm7ICIJ2i","sessionID":"ses_1135b46adffe7APFrgclWh2WTn","snapshot":"7ec9f031736230e028b7121093c1eec449fc8d71","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782086964394,"sessionID":"ses_1135b46adffe7APFrgclWh2WTn","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-ab918068c6710abc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"// Context block\n// File: Services/SoccerDataStore.cs\n// Purpose: Central in-memory data store for the Brazilian Soccer MCP server. The store\n// loads every CSV once (matches + players) and exposes the unified collections plus the\n// shared TeamNameNormalizer and DateParser to the query services. Loading happens lazily\n// on first access so the MCP server starts quickly and tests can construct the store\n// without paying the load cost when they only need the normalizer. A custom data\n// directory can be injected for tests.\n// Language: C# (.NET 10). Owner: Brazilian Soccer MCP benchmark implementation.\n\nusing BrazilianSoccerMcp.Data;\nusing BrazilianSoccerMcp.Models;\n\nnamespace BrazilianSoccerMcp.Services;\n\n/// <summary>In-memory store of all loaded matches and players.</summary>\npublic sealed class SoccerDataStore\n{\n    private readonly object _gate = new();\n    private List<MatchRecord> _matches = new();\n    private List<PlayerRecord> _players = new();\n    private bool _matchesLoaded;\n    private bool _playersLoaded;\n\n    public TeamNameNormalizer Normalizer { get; } = new();\n    public DateParser Dates { get; } = new();\n    public DataLoader Loader { get; }\n\n    public SoccerDataStore()\n    {\n        Loader = new DataLoader(Normalizer, Dates);\n    }\n\n    /// <summary>Loads matches if needed and returns the cached list.</summary>\n    public IReadOnlyList<MatchRecord> Matches\n    {\n        get\n        {\n            lock (_gate)\n            {\n                if (!_matchesLoaded)\n                {\n                    _matches = Loader.LoadAllMatches();\n                    _matchesLoaded = true;\n                }\n                return _matches;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// <summary>Loads players if needed and returns the cached list.</summary>\n    public IReadOnlyList<PlayerRecord> Players\n    {\n        get\n        {\n            lock (_gate)\n            {\n                if (!_playersLoaded)\n                {\n                    _players = Loader.LoadPlayers();\n                    _playersLoaded = true;\n                }\n                return _players;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// <summary>Forces matches to be loaded eagerly (used by tests and warmups).</summary>\n    public void EnsureMatchesLoaded() => _ = Matches;\n\n    /// <summary>Forces players to be loaded eagerly.</summary>\n    public void EnsurePlayersLoaded() => _ = Players;\n}\n","filePath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-2vdvakbf/retort-a07630997387/src/BrazilianSoccerMcp/Services/SoccerDataStore.cs"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-2vdvakbf/retort-a07630997387/src/BrazilianSoccerMcp/Services/SoccerDataStore.cs","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"src/BrazilianSoccerMcp/Services/SoccerDataStore.cs","time":{"start":1782086964390,"end":1782086964393}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Builds. Now let me write a quick test to verify data loads correctly before going further. Actually let me proceed to write the services and the store, then test.\n\nLet me create the SoccerDataStore facade and the services. Let me write them now.\n\nSoccerDataStore: holds matches and players; provides shared normalizer. Services can be constructed from it.\n\nLet me write services:\n\nMatchService: SearchMatches(team, opponent?, competition?, season?, from?, to?), HeadToHead(a,b), LastMatchBetween(a,b).\n\nTeamService: GetTeamStats(team, season?, competition?, venue?). CompareTeams(a,b).\n\nPlayerService: SearchPlayers(name, nationality?, club?, position?, minOverall?, topN?).\n\nCompetitionService: GetStandings(competition, season, topN?) - computes from matches; GetChampion(competition, season). For Brasileirao standings: group by team, points = 3*wins+draws, GD, GF.\n\nStatisticsService: GetAverageGoals(competition, season?), GetBiggestWins(topN, competition?), GetHomeWinRate(competition, season?).\n\nLet me implement. I'll use a venue enum (All, Home, Away).","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eeca90217001hAcfQaC0p19Wpe","sessionID":"ses_1135b46adffe7APFrgclWh2WTn","messageID":"msg_eeca8ee9d00174pTtQm7ICIJ2i"}}
