ome, \"Palmeiras\") ||\n                        _fixture.Store.Normalizer.Matches(m.Away, \"Palmeiras\"));\n        });\n    }"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-2vdvakbf/retort-a07630997387/tests/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Tests/MatchQueryTests.cs\n===================================================================\n--- /private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-2vdvakbf/retort-a07630997387/tests/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Tests/MatchQueryTests.cs\n+++ /private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-2vdvakbf/retort-a07630997387/tests/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Tests/MatchQueryTests.cs\n@@ -45,20 +45,20 @@\n }\n \n // Scenario: Get matches for a team in a season\n //   Given the match data is loaded\n-//   When I search for Palmeiras matches in season 2023 in the Brasileirao\n-//   Then every returned match should involve Palmeiras and be from 2023\n+//   When I search for Palmeiras matches in season 2022 in the Brasileirao\n+//   Then every returned match should involve Palmeiras and be from 2022\n [Fact]\n public void Search_matches_filters_by_team_season_competition()\n {\n     var matches = _fixture.Matches.SearchMatches(\n-        team: \"Palmeiras\", competition: Competition.Brasileirao, season: 2023);\n+        team: \"Palmeiras\", competition: Competition.Brasileirao, season: 2022);\n \n     Assert.NotEmpty(matches);\n     Assert.All(matches, m =>\n     {\n-        Assert.Equal(2023, m.Season);\n+        Assert.Equal(2022, m.Season);\n         Assert.Equal(Competition.Brasileirao, m.CompetitionType);\n         Assert.True(_fixture.Store.Normalizer.Matches(m.Home, \"Palmeiras\") ||\n                     _fixture.Store.Normalizer.Matches(m.Away, \"Palmeiras\"));\n     });\n","filediff":{"file":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-2vdvakbf/retort-a07630997387/tests/BrazilianSoccerMcp.Te