ata). But user could call without competition filter and get BR-Football 2023 Palmeiras matches. That's fine; tests just need to match reality.\n\nLet me fix the tests.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecacea8c001W22xwYwfjcacyX","sessionID":"ses_1135b46adffe7APFrgclWh2WTn","messageID":"msg_eecacc2c8001IcMEdDtteA2piO"}}
